复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006691562058997963,"emotions":[{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":7,"sort":7},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":1,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":1,"sort":9},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":0,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af6bc04f4429d1fd72fb0eb","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794554884187,"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:28:04","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6bc00f4429d1fd72fb0e3","chatId":"59b2680ac89f4686a50643ceeb85f502","sessionId":null,"userId":100122,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"发火后又后悔，这种反复其实很折磨人。你愿意这样坦诚地说出来，已经很不容易了。回想一下，别人那句话里，通常是什么最容易刺到你呢？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"发火后又后悔，这种反复其实很折磨人。你愿意这样坦诚地说出来，已经很不容易了。回想一下，别人那句话里，通常是什么最容易刺到你呢？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2520,"promptTokens":1057,"completionTokens":168,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:28:00"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909831334593406,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6bc00f4429d1fd72fb0e2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794554880420,"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:28:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6bc00f4429d1fd72fb0e2","chatId":"59b2680ac89f4686a50643ceeb85f502","sessionId":null,"userId":100122,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"不知不觉就淡了吧……也可能是我自己的问题。有时候别人一句无心的话，我就会特别烦躁，忍不住发火，事后又后悔。<第9轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":18,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909831334593406,"emotions":[{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":5,"sort":7},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":1,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af6bc00f4429d1fd72fb0e3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794554880418,"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:28:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6bbfcf4429d1fd72fb0d2","chatId":"59b2680ac89f4686a50643ceeb85f502","sessionId":null,"userId":100122,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"听起来你身边能倾诉的人不多，这种孤单感在难受的时候会更明显。朋友慢慢疏远，是发生了什么事，还是不知不觉就淡了？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"听起来你身边能倾诉的人不多，这种孤单感在难受的时候会更明显。朋友慢慢疏远，是发生了什么事，还是不知不觉就淡了？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3175,"promptTokens":960,"completionTokens":152,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:27:56"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":17,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012430701227226913,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6bbfcf4429d1fd72fb0d1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794554876071,"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:27:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6bbfcf4429d1fd72fb0d1","chatId":"59b2680ac89f4686a50643ceeb85f502","sessionId":null,"userId":100122,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（停顿了一下）哦……行吧。身边能说话的人？好像……还真没有。同事就是同事，朋友也慢慢疏远了。<第8轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":16,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012430701227226913,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":6,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":6,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":4,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":2,"sort":5},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":1,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2}],"relationId":"6af6bbfcf4429d1fd72fb0d2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794554876068,"createTime":"2026-1